WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Observe: Observe where both toys start before they are gathered in the left tray.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:22.800
Goal 1: Move the blue toy to the right tray.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:39.600
Goal 2: Brush the blue toy’s original spot, then put the brush back.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:58.800
Goal 3: Return the blue toy to its original position.
